--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- natural periods and mode shapes of an R3 chain catenary at 100 m depth
-- Modal analysis (nModes) of the grounded R3 chain catenary of chain_catenary_r3_100m.dat: the
-- 12 lowest natural frequencies and mode shapes about the static equilibrium, ends held, with
-- the Morison added mass and the linearised seabed contact stiffness. Written to
-- <root>.modes.out; the deck is static (no dtM/TMax), so no time march follows.
